name: facebook-website-factory-compliant
version: 2.0 — COMPLIANT (no scraping, opt-in only)
description: Sells affordable websites to contractors on FB — Lead Ads + Comment-to-DM -> HITL -> Build -> 402 -> Long-form Reel case study
worker: clawdyclaw.tinkerers.workers.dev
production: facebook.clawdyclaw.com
rate_limit: 30 Reels/24h/Page API, sustainable 1-3/day/Page
monetization_gate: 10k followers + 600k mins/60d + 5 videos + 30d Page age

===== WHAT IS NOT ALLOWED (blocked) =====
❌ Scraping FB profiles, Groups, Pages, Marketplace for contractor leads
❌ Harvesting emails/phones from About sections with bots
❌ Cold DM via Messenger/IG without opt-in (spam, block rate >1% = Page flagged)
❌ Fully autonomous money movement without HITL
===== COMPLIANT WORKFLOW =====
steps:

LEAD_IN — OPT-IN ONLY (Meta-approved):
a) Facebook Lead Ads:
Target: Roofers, Plumbers, Electricians, General Contractors (Home Services)
Creative: Lobster tinkerer time-lapse building a site (15s, 9:16, 540x960 min)
Hook: "Affordable contractor sites — $297 — built in 4h"
User action: Fills Lead Form = explicit consent to contact (compliant)
Webhook: POST https://facebook.clawdyclaw.com/mcp/v1/webhooks/meta
{ object: "page", entry: [{ changes: [{ field: "leadgen", value: { leadgen_id, page_id, form_id, ad_id } }] }] }
b) Comment-to-DM (alternative):
Post in contractor Groups WITH admin permission: "Drop WEBSITE and I'll send free teardown"
User comments "WEBSITE"
API: POST /{comment_id}/private_replies { message: "Want a free teardown? Reply YES for details" }
This creates opt-in for Messenger 24h window
QUALIFY — Workers AI:
Tool: llm_infer (Llama 3.3 70B)
Input: leadgen data + ad_id + form answers
Output: { business_type, budget, timeline, has_domain, urgency_score }
Store: Vector Memory + D1
HITL GATE — REQUIRED FOR MONEY:
task_graph status: pending -> approved -> executed
UI: Command Center at facebook.clawdyclaw.com shows lead + score
Human approves before any outreach. This is what keeps App Review passing.
No auto-sales.
OUTREACH — Compliant Messenger/WhatsApp:
Condition: approved + within 24h of opt-in
Channel A: Messenger: "Saw you asked about affordable sites, here's 2-min Loom teardown for {business}"
Channel B: WhatsApp Cloud API (free hosted): Same message + Loom link
Template: Must not be promotional if outside 24h — use approved template
Tool: whatsapp/cloud-api/send, messenger/send
BUILD — Autonomous (off-FB, fully allowed):
Subagents: 20 domains as builders
Stack: Vite + globals.css (fb-blue glacier + rusty red), Cloudflare Pages
Design: Use 21st.dev MCP component
Delivery: subdomain: {business}.facebook.clawdyclaw.com or custom domain
Time: 4h target
COLLECT — 402 + Stripe (off-FB):
x402: $297 payment -> wallet or Stripe bank
Tool: stripe.create_invoice / 402 handshake
After payment -> mark task_graph: executed
Revenue shuttle: Stripe -> bank OR 402 -> crypto wallet
CASE STUDY REEL — Long-form monetization (highest RPM):
This is the flywheel: every sale = content
Template: Before/After, build timelapse, testimonial
Format: Long-form 1-3 min (not just 15s Reels) — $3k per 1M vs $50 Reels
Specs: 9:16, 1080x1920, burned captions, hook in 1s: "We built a roofer site in 4h"
API: POST /{page_id}/video_reels { upload_phase: start, file_size } -> upload -> publish
Hashtags: 3-5 max: #contractorwebsites #roofers #facebookreels #clawdyclaw
Audio: Trending, drives reach more than hashtags
Check: original content only, no watermarks, same-day = 50% more RecSys boost
LEARN:
Store retention, views, $ in Vector Memory
Next Lead Ad creative improves
Metrics to track for factory notes
kpi:

leadgen_cost: target <$5 per contractor lead
approval_rate: % leads approved in HITL
close_rate: % approved -> paid
reels_rpm: long-form $ per 1k views
content_monetization_progress: followers / 10k, mins / 600k
App Review notes (keep for submission)
